sequenceDiagram
 participant N as S04 Narrative
 participant M as S16 Memory
 participant R as S40 Review
 participant S as S08 Snapshot
 participant X as S18 Context
 participant L as S09 Lineage
 N->>M: Extract candidate claims from fixed script
 M-->>R: Candidate evidence/conflicts
 R->>S: Authorized acceptance decision
 S->>S: CAS manifest + outbox
 S-->>M: Accepted source manifest event
 M->>M: Validate source + commit canon checkpoint
 M-->>X: Canon committed
 M-->>L: Changed claim refs
 X->>M: Read minimum checkpoint and scoped facts
 X-->>N: Versioned ContextPack for next episode
 L->>L: Compute downstream impact for superseded claims
